Chain this togthere with: https://github.com/klausj1/homeassistant-statistics

Example automation to trigger this component to pull the file from NT power, then trigger the statistics import


alias: "NTPower: Fetch and Import Energy Data"
description: ""
triggers:
  - at: "02:00:00"
    trigger: time
actions:
  - action: ntpower.refresh
    data: {}
  - delay:
      hours: 0
      minutes: 0
      seconds: 30
      milliseconds: 0
  - data:
      timezone_identifier: America/Toronto
      delimiter: \t
      decimal: false
      filename: ntpower_data/counterdata.tsv
    action: import_statistics.import_from_file
mode: single
